# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Keep secrets and big/binary files OUT of git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Auto-download vehicle/map mods: large, and often not yours to redistribute.
# Keep the .zip files only on your laptop, inside Resources/Client/.
Resources/Client/*.zip
Resources/Client/*.ZIP

# The downloaded server binary + runtime junk (re-download fresh on the host).
BeamMP-Server*.exe
Server.exe
*.log
crash/
logs/

# ServerConfig.toml is committed as a TEMPLATE with a placeholder AuthKey.
# Once you paste your REAL AuthKey into it locally, do NOT let git track that
# change. From inside this folder, run:
#     git update-index --skip-worktree ServerConfig.toml
# (to start tracking edits again later: --no-skip-worktree)
